---
// About page for Cherie Reads
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>About | Cherie Reads</title>
    <script defer src="/_vercel/insights/script.js"></script>
    <style>
      :root {
        --card-bg: #fcfbf9;
        --border-color: #c4d6c7;
        --text-color: #2c352d;
        --text-muted: #556358;
        --accent: #1e3d24; /* Richer, deeper forest green */
        --accent-hover: #122617;
        --serif-font: "Georgia", "Times New Roman", serif;
      }
      body {
        font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d8e4da 0%, #eef3ef 50%, #d2e0d4 100%);
        color: var(--text-color);
        line-height: 1.6;
        min-height: 100vh;
      }
      header {
        background: rgba(252, 251, 249, 0.95);
        backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        padding: 20px 40px;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(30, 61, 36, 0.05);
      }
      .brand-container {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
      }
      .brand-icon {
        width: 26px;
        height: 26px;
        fill: var(--accent);
        opacity: 0.85;
      }
      header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: var(--serif-font);
        font-size: 2rem;
        color: var(--accent);
        letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        font-weight: normal;
        font-style: italic;
      }
      nav a {
        color: var(--text-muted);
        text-decoration: none;
        margin-left: 20px;
        font-weight: 500;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        transition: color 0.2s;
      }
      nav a:hover {
        color: var(--accent);
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 40px auto;
        padding: 40px;
        background: var(--card-bg);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(30, 61, 36, 0.04);
      }
      h2 {
        font-family: var(--serif-font);
        color: var(--accent);
        border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-color);
        padding-bottom: 8px;
        margin-top: 0;
        font-weight: normal;
      }
      h3 {
        font-family: var(--serif-font);
        margin-top: 30px;
        color: var(--accent);
        font-weight: normal;
      }
      .profile-links {
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
        margin: 20px 0;
      }
      .profile-links li {
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }
      .profile-links a {
        color: var(--accent);
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 500;
      }
      .profile-links a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <div class="brand-container">
        <svg class="brand-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <path d="M19 3H5c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L3 19c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V5c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm0 16H5V5h14v14z M6 6h5v6H6zm6 0h5v6h-5z"/>
        </svg>
        <h1>Cherie Reads</h1>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/guide">Guide</a>
        <a href="https://book-matchmaker.vercel.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Literary Apothecary 🌿</a>
        <a href="/about">About</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
      <h2>About Me</h2>
      <p>Welcome to Cherie Reads! I am a lifelong reader who often feels much more at home in the pages of a book than in the real world. For me, reading has always been a quiet sanctuary and a wonderful way to explore completely different lives, worlds, and perspectives.</p>
      
      <h3>What You Will Find Here</h3>
      <p>I read widely across all genres, though I hold a special fondness for sweeping fantasy and rich historical fiction. Above all, I am drawn to stories that pack a genuine emotional punch, feature characters who feel like real, flawed people, and make me think about the world in entirely new ways.</p>
      <p>This space serves as my digital reading journal. I created it to catalog my thoughts, organize my reviews by star ratings and genres, and share my love of reading with fellow book enthusiasts.</p>

      <h3>Find Me Online</h3>
      <p>If you want to connect, say hello, or share a book recommendation, you can reach me directly at <a href="mailto:cheriereads@gmail.com">cheriereads@gmail.com</a>. You can also find my virtual bookshelves and reading stats across these platforms:</p>
      
      <ul class="profile-links">
        <li>Goodreads: <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/cheriereads" target="_blank">cheriereads</a></li>
        <li>Pagebound: <a href="https://pagebound.co/users/VioletPeanut" target="_blank">VioletPeanut</a></li>
        <li>Hardcover: <a href="https://hardcover.app/@VioletPeanut" target="_blank">@VioletPeanut</a></li>
        <li>Fable: <a href="https://fable.co/fabler/cherie-344162723581" target="_blank">Cherie on Fable</a></li>
        <li>StoryGraph: <a href="https://app.thestorygraph.com/profile/VioletPeanut" target="_blank">VioletPeanut</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
